    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #313\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-227-module-contract-11-12-author-manifests-thr_dmm2wwcnpt`.\n\nThis branch authors `ModuleManifest` declarations (module-contract issue #227) for the library, mail sync/mailbox, and Inbox pipeline modules:\n\n- `backend/packages/data/src/library/libraryModuleManifest.ts` — Books/Movies, `library-grid` view type, `0005_library_module.sql`\n- `backend/packages/data/src/mail/mailModuleManifest.ts` — Mailboxes/Folders/Emails, `mailbox-client` view type, `mail.reindexPersonEmails`/`mail.linkPeopleByEmail` heartbeat actions, the per-mailbox `semprec-mailsync` worker, `0006`/`0007` migrations\n- `backend/packages/data/src/inbox/inboxModuleManifest.ts` — Inbox/Inbox item types/Processing proposals, `journal-inbox` view type, `semprec.tick` heartbeat action, `0010` migration\n- Wired into `backend/packages/data/src/index.ts`\n- New load tests in `backend/packages/data/src/__tests__/libraryMailInboxModuleManifests.test.ts`\n\nFull backend suite verified: build across all 9 packages, unit tier (83 tests), integration tier (373 tests), e2e tier (5 tests), and the module-boundaries check — all green.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
